rectangle "==On-board sensors\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>\n\nLSM6DS3TR-C IMU (accelerometer + gyroscope) and PDM microphone, soldered on the board." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw=>> as Onboardsensors

rectangle "xiao-nrf52840-sensors\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-eGlhby1ucmY1Mjg0MC1zZW5zb3Jz>> {
  rectangle "Firmware\n<size:16>[Container: Rust binary, no_std, flashed with scripts/flash.sh (crates/firmware)]</size>" <<Boundary-RmlybXdhcmU=>> {
    rectangle "==main\n<size:16>[Component]</size>\n\nStarts the links, then serves commands." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware.main
    rectangle "==link\n<size:16>[Component]</size>\n\nThe three ways in: USB, BLE, UART." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware.link
    rectangle "==sensors\n<size:16>[Component]</size>\n\nWho holds which sensor; grants or refuses every request." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware.sensors
    rectangle "==imu\n<size:16>[Component]</size>\n\nThe IMU chip's registers: on/off, rate, range, read." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware.imu
    rectangle "==mic\n<size:16>[Component]</size>\n\nThe microphone: power, clock, audio blocks." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware.mic
    rectangle "==board\n<size:16>[Component]</size>\n\nWhich pins the sensors are on and how each is powered." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQ=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware.board
  }

  rectangle "==Proto\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library, no_std (crates/proto)]</size>\n\nThe messages the API and the firmware exchange, and how they become bytes. Built into both, so they cannot disagree." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Proto
